OL,3,GNEWSAWeather warning lifted as third
OL,4,Astorm to hit Scotland eases off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA weather warning put in place as a
OL,7,Fthird storm in a matter of days hit
OL,8,FScotland has now been lifted.
OL,10,FThousands of homes across the country
OL,11,Fremain without power in the aftermath
OL,12,Fof Storm Boelo and several days of high
OL,13,Fwinds and heavy rain.
OL,15,FA yellow wind warning, covering most of
OL,16,Fthe country as well as parts of
OL,17,Fnorthern England and Northern Ireland,
OL,18,Fcame into effect at 03:00 but was
OL,19,Flifted at18:00.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
